## Original Content
Presidente da SAD considera que os "três grandes" já esgotaram a capacidade de crescimento dentro de Portugal. Ainda, 10 dos 16 feridos em atropelamento em Albufeira já tiveram alta hospitalar.

## Summary
The Estrela da Amadora SAD has sold 90% of its shares to a German group. The president cites the 'big three' Portuguese teams have exhausted growth potential domestically. Separately, 10 out of 16 victims of an Albufeira hit-and-run have been discharged from the hospital.

## Key Points
- Estrela da Amadora SAD sold 90% to a German group
- President attributes sale to 'big three' teams' limited domestic growth potential
- 10 out of 16 Albufeira hit-and-run victims discharged from hospital


